# Akamu ACME — Server Status
Output docs/gifs/13-acme-status.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# ACME Server Status — akamu-rsa.cert-lab.local"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab acme-status -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 5s
